# Photo Studio Pivot — Git Discipline

GridMenu is pivoting to an AI food photo studio. Workflow docs live in `docs/pivot/`.

## Git workflow (user needs guidance)

The user has limited git experience. Follow `docs/pivot/GIT_WORKFLOW.md`:

- Commit directly to `main` (pull first, push to `origin/main`). Do **not** create chunk
  branches unless the user explicitly asks.
- Proactively confirm they are on up-to-date `main`, and spell out any git commands they need
  to run themselves rather than assuming knowledge.
- Never run destructive git commands (`reset --hard`, `push --force`, history rewrites) without
  explicit approval.
- Production deploys are manual (`main` does not auto-deploy). If a change requires env vars or
  migrations in production, flag the relevant steps from the deployment checklist in
  `docs/pivot/GIT_WORKFLOW.md`.
